{"unit_id":"dylan121322__llm-adaptive#card-zh","repo":"dylan121322/llm-adaptive","commit":"305be1c75d094c2bfcee014b768906e2b5558b9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"llm-adaptive 是面向 DSH Web 的自适应模型路由插件。它注册 adaptive 模型提供方，在每次请求时读取本地模型池，结合当前用户消息、近期对话和会话目标判断任务难度，并选择 low、medium、high 或 critical 档位。插件按对应配置的 provider 路由链依次尝试后端，转发成功后透传流式结果；分类失败时使用 medium 档。它还支持 sticky 防降档、会话目标摘要、120 秒分类缓存和决策日志，适合希望按任务复杂度自动分配模型的 DSH 用户。需要配置模型池及可用的 DeepSeek 分类器密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-376","index.js:379-395"]}
{"unit_id":"dylan121322__llm-adaptive#card-en","repo":"dylan121322/llm-adaptive","commit":"305be1c75d094c2bfcee014b768906e2b5558b9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"llm-adaptive routes DSH requests by task complexity. It classifies messages with session context and tries providers from the configured chain. Failures default to medium. Sticky levels, goal summaries, caching, and routing logs are supported. Requires a model pool and DeepSeek classifier key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-376","index.js:379-395"]}
