{"unit_id":"dylan121322__llm-adaptive#feature-1","repo":"dylan121322/llm-adaptive","commit":"305be1c75d094c2bfcee014b768906e2b5558b9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"llm-adaptive 的功能「按请求难度分档」：每次 LLM 流式请求会结合用户文本、近期消息和会话目标，调用分类器选择 low、medium、high 或 critical 档；分类无结果时采用 medium。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-347"]}
{"unit_id":"dylan121322__llm-adaptive#feature-2","repo":"dylan121322/llm-adaptive","commit":"305be1c75d094c2bfcee014b768906e2b5558b9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"llm-adaptive 的功能「沿配置路由链转发」：插件从模型池读取档位对应的 provider 链，展开活跃 provider 并过滤无模型项；它逐个准备后端调用，成功后透传流式响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:262-287","index.js:357-375"]}
{"unit_id":"dylan121322__llm-adaptive#feature-3","repo":"dylan121322/llm-adaptive","commit":"305be1c75d094c2bfcee014b768906e2b5558b9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"llm-adaptive 的功能「会话目标与 sticky 档位」：插件按会话保存目标摘要和上次档位，每 20 轮重算目标；任务未收尾且没有降档提示时，较低的新判档会沿用上一档。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:174-198","index.js:248-255","index.js:329-345"]}
{"unit_id":"dylan121322__llm-adaptive#feature-4","repo":"dylan121322/llm-adaptive","commit":"305be1c75d094c2bfcee014b768906e2b5558b9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"llm-adaptive 的功能「决策缓存和日志」：分类结果按用户文本头部及目标指纹缓存 120 秒；每次路由将档位、判定原因和候选链摘要追加到插件日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:227-259","index.js:346-348"]}
{"unit_id":"dylan121322__llm-adaptive#caveat-1","repo":"dylan121322/llm-adaptive","commit":"305be1c75d094c2bfcee014b768906e2b5558b9f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"llm-adaptive 使用 DeepSeek 分类器处理当前用户文本及近期对话上下文，并需提供分类器 API 密钥；分类请求发送到配置的分类器 URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:105-114","index.js:117-134","index.js:71-78"]}
